Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:24.33,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正行楷_GBK\c&H121316&\an7\fs45\frz5.126\pos(620.394,954.435)}歡迎來電諮詢{\i1}!
